04:59:16.478 --> 04:59:23.878
usually denoted as s and t respectively. The
maximum flow problem asks with an infinite

04:59:23.878 --> 04:59:30.458
input source, how much flow can we push through
the network without exceeding the capacity

04:59:30.458 --> 04:59:36.920
of any edge and it's not at all obvious how
