05:08:58.090 --> 05:09:04.290
of the graph from the source to the sink.
However, recall that a depth for search traversal

05:09:04.290 --> 05:09:10.398
is essentially random. So it's possible for
you to pick that middle edge with a capacity

05:09:10.398 --> 05:09:16.640
of one every single time. And what that'll
do is it'll limit flow, you can push from

05:09:16.640 --> 05:09:21.738
the source the sink to be one, so one is always
going to be your bottleneck value, so you're

05:09:21.738 --> 05:09:29.090
never going to be able to argument the flow
by more than one unit. This results in flipping

05:09:29.090 --> 05:09:37.138
